称** | 主监控页面 |\n| **分辨率** | 1920 × 1080 |\n| **背景色** | `#000000`（黑色） |\n\n页面已就绪，您可以接下来：\n1. **添加图形组件** — 如仪表盘、趋势图、设备图标等（`create_widget`）\n2. **绘制图形基元** — 如矩形边框、管道线条、圆形指示灯等（`create_rect` / `create_line` / `create_circle`）\n3. **绑定数据点** — 将 SCADA 点位绑定到组件属性上（`bind_point`）\n4. **添加文字标签** — 标注区域名称或说明（`create_text`）\n\n请问您接下来想在页面上添加什么内容？", "reasoning": "The page was created successfully. Let me inform the user about the result."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128666, "output_tokens": 411, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 17699.956799973734}, "judge": null}
