5, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **高限报警配置成功！**\n\n| 配置项 | 值 |\n|--------|-----|\n| 报警 ID | `alarm_pt101_high` |\n| 监控点位 | PT101 |\n| 高限阈值 | 2.0 |\n| 优先级 | 中等 (medium) |\n\n当 PT101 的值超过 2.0 时，系统将触发该报警。如需调整阈值、添加死区或低限报警，随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "The alarm was created successfully. I should inform the user about the result."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128682, "output_tokens": 332, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10617.739400011487}, "judge": null}
