-----|\n| 报警 ID | `alarm_pt101_high` |\n| 监控点位 | PT101 |\n| 高限阈值 | 2.0 |\n| 优先级 | 中等 (medium) |\n| 状态 | 已启用 |\n\n当 PT101 的值超过 **2.0** 时，系统将触发中等优先级报警。如需进一步调整（如添加死区、低限报警等），请随时告知。", "reasoning": "The alarm was created successfully. Let me provide a summary to the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128648, "output_tokens": 322, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10469.806199951563}, "judge": null}
