ro", "input_tokens": 64593, "output_tokens": 78, "latency_ms": 4082.8014999860898, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已成功在主页面（main_page）上添加了一个文本组件，显示内容为\"欢迎\"。该组件的ID为text_welcome，位置在(100,100)坐标处。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "成功了。现在应该告知用户任务已完成。接下来切换到DONE阶段。回复中包含\"next_state: DONE\"。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193181, "output_tokens": 357, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 17064.189099997748}, "judge": null}
