要执行什么更新。\n\n让我先创建一个基本的脚本结构，body可以写一个简单的日志记录或者更新操作。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 64215, "output_tokens": 338, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 13037.105499999598}, "judge": null}
