7069, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The user wants to create a script that triggers when PT101 changes. This is an \"on_change\" script bound to the tag PT101.\n\nI need to use the `create_script` function with:\n- id: a unique identifier for the script\n- name: a descriptive name\n- trigger: \"on_change\"\n- bound_tag: \"PT101\"\n- body: the script body (user said \"execute update\" but didn't specify what update - I should ask or provide a generic template)\n\nLet me create a script with a reasonable default body and the on_change trigger bound to PT101."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64566, "output_tokens": 183, "latency_ms": 5348.029800050426, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "脚本已创建成功！以下是配置详情：\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **脚本 ID** | `script_pt101_on_change` |\n| **名称** | PT101 变化触发脚本 |\n| **触发方式** | `on_change`（值变化时触发） |\n| **绑定标签** | `PT101` |\n\n脚本体中已预留了 `# TODO` 位置，你可以在那里编写具体的业务逻辑。目前脚本默认行为是：\n- 读取 PT101 的当前值\n- 记录日志\n\n如果你有具体的业务需求（比如报警联动、数据转发、写入其他点位等），告诉我，我可以帮你更新脚本内容。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The script was created successfully. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128781, "output_tokens": 495, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 13832.39269995829}, "judge": null}
