 which is a dynamic tool. Let me try using that.\n\nActually, looking at the create_page function, it has a \"background\" parameter. But for updating, I might need to use `update_screen`. Let me try that approach, or I could potentially use `delete_page` and `create_page` but that would lose all widgets.\n\nLet me try `update_screen` - it's described as \"Dynamic update_screen\" which might be able to update page properties."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64675, "output_tokens": 42, "latency_ms": 3733.227299991995, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "背景色已更新成功。现在进行项目校验：", "reasoning": "Good, the background has been updated. Now let me validate the project."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64760, "output_tokens": 121, "latency_ms": 3216.104200051632, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两项任务都已完成，以下是执行结果：\n\n| 任务 | 状态 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 修改主监控页面背景色 | ✅ 成功 | `main_page`（主页面）背景色已改为白色 `#FFFFFF` |\n| 项目校验 | ✅ 通过 | 校验状态：`validated`，无任何错误 |\n\n项目校验全部通过，配置一致性良好。如果需要进一步操作（如部署），请告诉我。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Both tasks completed successfully. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 258000, "output_tokens": 548, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21707.94270001352}, "judge": null}
