tool for that, I'll need to use the dynamic tools available. Let me try a combination approach or inform the user.\n\nActually, looking at the dynamic tools, `update_screen` seems like the most logical choice for updating a screen/page property like background color. Let me try that, and then validate the project."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65141, "output_tokens": 163, "latency_ms": 5956.460999965202, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两项任务都已成功完成 ✅\n\n**1. 背景色修改**\n- 页面：主页面 (`main_page`)\n- 新背景色：白色 (`#FFFFFF`)\n- 状态：已更新成功\n\n**2. 项目校验**\n- 校验结果：**通过** ✅\n- 错误数量：0\n- 当前状态：`validated`（已校验）\n\n项目校验没有发现任何问题，所有配置一致且完整。如果后续需要将项目下装到生产环境，可以直接进行部署操作。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Both operations completed successfully:\n1. The background color of the main page was updated to white (#FFFFFF)\n2. The project validation passed with no errors\n\nLet me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193711, "output_tokens": 978, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 32705.89540002402}, "judge": null}
