log\" and add a reasonable description. I won't assume the unit since the user didn't specify it."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64503, "output_tokens": 141, "latency_ms": 6525.14629997313, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 压力点位 **Press_1** 已成功创建！\n\n当前配置：\n- **Tag 名称**：Press_1\n- **类型**：analog（模拟量）\n- **描述**：压力点位\n\n如果需要，我还可以帮您：\n- 设置**工程单位**（如 bar、kPa、psi 等）\n- 设置**量程范围**（min/max）\n- 配置**高低限报警**\n\n需要补充这些信息吗？", "reasoning": "The point was created successfully. Let me inform the user about the result and ask if they want to add any additional metadata like unit, min, max values, or alarms."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128715, "output_tokens": 398, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14969.031199987512}, "judge": null}
