larms.\n\nI should ask the user for more details:\n1. There are currently no temperature points in the project\n2. Ask if they want to create temperature points first\n3. Or if they have specific tag names in mind"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128549, "output_tokens": 337, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 12036.771800019778}, "judge": null}
