unt": 500, "selected": "get_widget", "action": "get_widget", "args": {"action": "get_widget"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.03840000135824084, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64213, "output_tokens": 236, "latency_ms": 9080.902800022159, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您将主画面上的泵1绑定到马达3。首先我需要查找主画面的页面信息和泵1的控件ID。", "reasoning": "The user wants to bind pump 1 on the main page to motor 3. To do this, I need to:\n\n1. First, find the main page - I should list pages to get the page ID\n2. Then I need to find the widget ID for pump 1 on that page\n3. And bind it to motor 3\n\nLet me start by listing pages to find the main page, and also check what widgets exist on it.\n\nActually, I need to understand what the user means by \"bind pump 1 to motor 3\". In SCADA HMI context, this likely means binding a pump widget's properties to a motor tag/point. So I need to:\n1. Find the main page ID\n2. Find the pump 1 widget ID on that page\n3. Use bind_point to bind the widget to a motor tag\n\nLet me first list pages to find the main page."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64500, "output_tokens": 391, "latency_ms": 12629.625700006727, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "找到了主画面（ID: `main_page`）。现在我来将泵1控件绑定到马达3标签。", "reasoning": "Found the main page with ID \"main_page\". Now I need to find the pump 1 widget on this page. I should check if there's a way to list widgets on a page. Looking at the available tools, I don't see a direct \"list_widgets\" function, but I can try to use get_widget to see if there's a pump widget.\n\nActually, the user said \"泵1\" (pump 1), so the widget_id might be something like \"pump_1\" or \"pump1\". And \"马达3\" (motor 3) would be the tag to bind to, likely \"motor_3\" or \"MOTOR_3\".\n\nLet me try to bind the pump widget to the motor tag. I'll use bind_point with:\n- page_id: \"main_page\"\n- widget_id: probably \"pump_1\" (I should try this)\n- property: \"value\" or \"motor\" - for a pump widget, binding to motor makes sense\n- tag: \"motor_3\" or \"MOTOR_3\"\n\nActually, I should ask the user for clarification or try to get more info. But let me try a reasonable guess first. In SCADA systems, pump widgets often have a \"motor\" or \"value\" property that can be bound.\n\nLet me try to bind pump_1 to motor_3. The property for a pump widget that controls its status is typically \"value\" or \"status\" or \"motor\"."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64932, "output_tokens": 100, "latency_ms": 3094.526000029873, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "控件名称不匹配，让我尝试其他可能的命名方式：", "reasoning": "The widget pump_1 was not found. Let me try other possible widget IDs like \"pump1\" or \"PUMP_1\"."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65073, "output_tokens": 107, "latency_ms": 2901.3700000359677, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "Still not found. The error message still says \"pump_1\" which is strange since I tried \"pump1\". Let me try \"PUMP_1\" or maybe I need to get widget information differently. Actually, there doesn't seem to be a list_widgets function available.\n\nLet me try to get_widget to see what's available, or I should ask the user for the exact widget ID."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65203, "output_tokens": 248, "latency_ms": 8806.357599969488, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "抱歉，我在主画面中没有找到名为 \"pump_1\" 或 \"pump1\" 的泵控件。\n\n**请确认以下信息：**\n\n1. **泵1的控件ID是什么？** （例如：`PUMP_001`, `feed_pump_1`, `pump_main_1` 等）\n2. **马达3的标签名是什么？** （例如：`MOTOR_3`, `motor_03`, `MTR_3` 等）\n3. **绑定的属性是什么？** 通常泵控件可以绑定：\n   - `value` - 泵的运行状态\n   - `speed` - 泵的转速\n   - `status` - 状态指示\n\n您可以提供这些信息，我就能准确完成绑定了。", "reasoning": "The get_widget didn't return useful info. Let me ask the user for the exact widget ID or try to find it another way. Actually, looking at the available tools again, there might not be a way to list all widgets on a page.\n\nLet me ask the user for clarification on the exact widget ID for pump 1 on the main page."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 323921, "output_tokens": 1082, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 37538.744000019506}, "judge": null}
