ate the necessary points and widgets\n\nBut looking at the results:\n- There's a main page: \"main_page\" (主画面)\n- No points are defined yet\n\nI need to ask the user for clarification because:\n1. There are no points defined - no \"马达3\" (Motor 3) tag exists\n2. I don't know if there's already a pump widget on the main page\n\nActually, I should be careful about the terminology:\n- \"泵1\" (Pump 1) - this could be a widget on the page\n- \"马达3\" (Motor 3) - this could be a SCADA point/tag\n\nThe `bind_point` function binds a SCADA point tag to a widget property. So if there's a pump widget called \"pump1\" on the main page, and a tag called \"MOTOR_3\" or similar, I could bind them.\n\nBut since there are no points defined, I need to either:\n1. Ask the user what tag name they want for Motor 3\n2. Create the point first\n\nAlso, I need to know if there's already a pump widget on the page. The output only shows the page exists but doesn't show the widgets on it.\n\nLet me ask the user for clarification."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128661, "output_tokens": 665, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 15659.251100034453}, "judge": null}
