"name": "test_profile"}], "visible_count": 500, "selected": "list_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.014999997802078724, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64213, "output_tokens": 343, "latency_ms": 11523.348500020802, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您完成这个绑定操作。首先，我需要查找主画面页面和相关的点位信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to bind \"泵1\" (pump 1) on the \"主画面\" (main page) to \"马达3\" (motor 3). \n\nFirst, I need to understand what they mean. They likely want to:\n1. Find the main page (主画面)\n2. Find a widget (pump 1) on that page\n3. Bind it to a motor point (motor 3)\n\nBut wait, looking at the available tools, I have `bind_point` which binds a SCADA point tag to a widget property. The user is asking to bind a pump widget to a motor - this doesn't quite make sense with the `bind_point` function which binds a tag to a widget property.\n\nLet me re-read the request: \"把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上\" - \"Bind pump 1 on the main page to motor 3\"\n\nThis could mean:\n1. They want to bind a widget (pump1) on the main page to a SCADA point that represents motor 3\n2. They want to connect the pump widget to show the status/value of motor 3\n\nI think they want to bind a pump widget to a motor-related SCADA point. \n\nFirst, I should:\n1. List pages to find the \"主画面\" (main page) and its ID\n2. List points or check what motor 3 tag exists\n\nLet me start by listing pages to find the main page."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64607, "output_tokens": 235, "latency_ms": 7957.120599981863, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "找到了主画面（ID: `main_page`）。现在我来查找相关的点位信息：", "reasoning": "Found the main page with ID \"main_page\". Now I need to find what widget is \"泵1\" (pump 1) and what tag represents \"马达3\" (motor 3).\n\nI should list points to find motor 3 related tags. Let me also check if there's a way to see widgets on a page - I could use get_widget but I need to know the widget_id first.\n\nActually, looking at the tools, I don't have a direct way to list widgets on a page. But I can try to bind a point to a widget if I know the IDs.\n\nThe user said \"泵1\" (pump 1) - this could be a widget_id like \"pump_1\" or \"pump1\"\nAnd \"马达3\" (motor 3) - this could be a SCADA point tag like \"MOTOR_3\" or \"motor_3\"\n\nLet me list points to see what motor-related tags exist."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64879, "output_tokens": 296, "latency_ms": 9947.061600047164, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中还没有配置任何 SCADA 点位。要完成绑定操作，我需要确认以下信息：\n\n1. **泵1 的 Widget ID**：主画面上泵1控件的 ID 是什么？（例如 `pump_1`、`pump1` 等）\n\n2. **马达3 的 SCADA 点位 Tag**：马达3对应的 SCADA 点位标签名是什么？（例如 `MOTOR_3`、`motor_3` 等）以及它的类型（analog/digital）？\n\n请提供这些信息，我就能帮您完成绑定。", "reasoning": "No points are defined yet. The user wants to bind a pump widget to motor 3, but there are no SCADA points configured.\n\nI need to ask the user for clarification:\n1. What is the widget ID for \"泵1\" (pump 1) on the main page?\n2. What is the SCADA point tag name for \"马达3\" (motor 3)?\n\nOr should I assume common naming conventions? Let me try to get the widget first - I could try common widget IDs like \"pump_1\", \"pump1\", \"PUMP_1\" etc.\n\nActually, let me ask the user for the specific details since I don't have enough information. The widget ID and the SCADA point tag need to be specified for the bind_point function."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193699, "output_tokens": 874, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 29879.034799989313}, "judge": null}
