|\n| **保留天数** | 30天、90天、365天 等 |\n\n你提供参数后，我马上帮你配好点位、历史采集和趋势图。", "reasoning": "The system currently has no points defined and no history configured. This is a fresh/empty project. I need to let the user know that:\n\n1. There are no SCADA points defined yet for the condenser outlet\n2. There's no history data configured\n\nI should ask the user for more details about what condenser outlet point(s) they want to monitor, so I can:\n1. Create the points\n2. Enable history on them\n3. Then create a trend group to display the data\n\nLet me ask the user for the specific details."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128688, "output_tokens": 551, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 15111.764599976595}, "judge": null}
