ints. I'll use appropriate units:\n- TI-201: Temperature, unit °C\n- PI-201: Pressure, unit could be kPa or bar\n- FI-201: Flow, unit could be m³/h or L/min\n\nI'll create all 3 points first."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 64231, "output_tokens": 438, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 13521.372999995947}, "judge": null}
