h_limit 100, priority high\n2. LL alarm: id could be \"alarm_LL_TI201\", tag \"TI-201\", low_limit 10, priority high\n\nThese two calls are independent of each other, so I can make them in parallel."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64630, "output_tokens": 191, "latency_ms": 5805.536899948493, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警已成功创建，配置如下：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 类型 | 限值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_HH_TI201` | TI-201 | HH（高高） | **100** | 🔴 high |\n| `alarm_LL_TI201` | TI-201 | LL（低低） | **10** | 🔴 high |\n\n- 当 **TI-201 ≥ 100** 时触发 HH 报警\n- 当 **TI-201 ≤ 10** 时触发 LL 报警\n\n如需调整死区（deadband）或后续的 H/L 常规报警，随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128858, "output_tokens": 523, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16085.019699996337}, "judge": null}
