hree.\n\nFor naming conventions:\n- TI = Temperature Indicator\n- PI = Pressure Indicator\n- FI = Flow Indicator\n\nI'll create them as analog type with appropriate units."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64661, "output_tokens": 217, "latency_ms": 6331.692599982489, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "三个点位创建成功。现在为它们启用历史记录：", "reasoning": "Good, all three points are created. Now I need to enable history for all three."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64981, "output_tokens": 184, "latency_ms": 3766.783299972303, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "完成！已创建三个 AI 点位并启用历史记录：\n\n| 点位 | 类型 | 单位 | 说明 | 历史采样 | 保留天数 |\n|------|------|------|------|----------|----------|\n| **TI-201** | analog | °C | 温度指示 | 1s 周期 | 30天 |\n| **PI-201** | analog | bar | 压力指示 | 1s 周期 | 30天 |\n| **FI-201** | analog | m³/h | 流量指示 | 1s 周期 | 30天 |\n\n如需调整量程范围（min/max）、采样间隔或报警限位，请告诉我。", "reasoning": "All done. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193873, "output_tokens": 737, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20833.428799989633}, "judge": null}
