m:\n- id: something like \"alarm_Ti201_HH\"\n- tag: TI-201\n- high_limit: 100\n- priority: high\n\nFor LL alarm:\n- id: something like \"alarm_Ti201_LL\"\n- tag: TI-201\n- low_limit: 10\n- priority: high\n\nThese two calls are independent of each other, so I can make them in the same block."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64643, "output_tokens": 179, "latency_ms": 6541.285699990112, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警已成功创建，汇总如下：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_TI201_HH` | TI-201 | HH（高高） | ≥ **100** | **high** |\n| `alarm_TI201_LL` | TI-201 | LL（低低） | ≤ **10** | **high** |\n\n两个报警均已启用。当 TI-201 的值超过 100 或低于 10 时，系统将触发对应报警。如需调整死区（deadband）或其他参数，随时告诉我。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128871, "output_tokens": 524, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16036.268599971663}, "judge": null}
