\" page exists by listing pages."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64370, "output_tokens": 348, "latency_ms": 9713.003400014713, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面 \"chemical screen\"（ID: `chem_screen`）已存在。现在我来同时添加 tank 和 button 两个控件。", "reasoning": "The page \"chemical screen\" exists with id \"chem_screen\". Now I need to:\n1. Create a tank widget on this page\n2. Create a button widget for \"start\"\n3. Bind the tank to TI-201\n\nLet me create both widgets first. I need to pick reasonable positions and sizes. Let me place the tank and button with some spacing.\n\nFor the tank, I'll use a widget_id like \"tank_01\" and for the button \"btn_start\".\nFor positions, I'll place them with reasonable spacing on a typical 1920x1080 screen.\n\nLet me create both widgets in parallel since they're independent."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64781, "output_tokens": 126, "latency_ms": 4872.843499993905, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个控件都创建成功了。现在将 tank 绑定到 TI-201 标签上。", "reasoning": "Both widgets are created. Now I need to bind the tank widget to the TI-201 tag. I'll bind the \"value\" property of the tank to TI-201."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64949, "output_tokens": 200, "latency_ms": 7320.593199983705, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部配置完成！以下是操作汇总：\n\n| 操作 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面** | `chemical screen` (chem_screen) |\n| **新增 Tank 控件** | `tank_01`，位置 (100,150)，尺寸 200×350 |\n| **绑定标签** | `tank_01.value` → `TI-201` |\n| **新增 Button 控件** | `btn_start`，位置 (400,300)，尺寸 150×50，绿色背景，标签 \"START\" |\n\n> 📌 **提示**：目前 START 按钮只是一个显示控件。如果你需要让按钮触发实际动作（比如写入某个标签值或执行脚本），请告诉我具体的控制逻辑，我可以进一步配置绑定或脚本。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All done! Let me summarize what was accomplished."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 258323, "output_tokens": 770, "co