e system to know what tags are available. Let me start by listing all points."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64406, "output_tokens": 221, "latency_ms": 6352.522499975748, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "目前系统中有 **2 个点位**：\n\n| 点位标签 | 类型 |\n|----------|------|\n| P1 | 模拟量 (analog) |\n| P2 | 数字量 (digital) |\n\n接下来为这两个点都启用历史记录：", "reasoning": "The system currently has 2 points:\n1. P1 - analog type\n2. P2 - digital type\n\nNow I need to enable history for both points. I can do this in parallel since they are independent calls."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64692, "output_tokens": 146, "latency_ms": 5347.586299991235, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 两个点位的历史记录都已启用成功。现在导出历史数据：", "reasoning": "Both history configurations have been enabled successfully. Now the user wants to export the history data. I'll use query_history to read the historical data for both points. Let me query both."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193312, "output_tokens": 456, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20108.75810001744}, "judge": null}
