556, "output_tokens": 166, "latency_ms": 5645.052199950442, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 已成功为 **TI-201** 创建两个报警：\n\n| 报警 ID | 类型 | 限值 | 优先级 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `alarm_TI201_HH` | High-High (HH) | **100** | 🔴 high |\n| `alarm_TI201_LL` | Low-Low (LL) | **10** | 🔴 high |\n\n当 TI-201 的值 **≥ 100** 或 **≤ 10** 时，将分别触发对应报警，并以高优先级通知。\n\n如需调整死区（deadband）或其他参数，随时告诉我！", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128784, "output_tokens": 426, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14397.077700006776}, "judge": null}
