 asking me to add history recording to all points in the entire factory and then export the data. Let me break this down:\n\n1. First, I need to list all existing points in the project\n2. Then enable history for each point\n3. Then export the history data\n\nLet me start by listing all points to see what we're working with."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64426, "output_tokens": 211, "latency_ms": 5824.005100002978, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "当前项目中共有 **2 个点位**：\n- **P1**：模拟量（analog）\n- **P2**：数字量（digital）\n\n接下来我为这两个点都启用历史记录。", "reasoning": "The project has 2 points:\n1. P1 - analog type\n2. P2 - digital type\n\nNow I need to enable history for both points. Since these are independent operations, I can make both calls at the same time."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64702, "output_tokens": 138, "latency_ms": 4861.654000007547, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个点的历史记录都已成功启用。现在让我查询并导出这两个点的历史数据：", "reasoning": "Both points now have history enabled. Now I need to query/export the history data for both points. I can use query_history to read historical data for each tag."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65613, "output_tokens": 485, "latency_ms": 14537.35370002687, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "任务完成！以下是汇总：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 全厂点位历史配置汇总\n\n### 1. 已启用历史记录的点位（共 2 个）\n\n| 点位 | 类型 | 采样模式 | 采样间隔 | 保留天数 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|----------|----------|------|\n| **P1** | 模拟量 (analog) | 周期采样 | 1 秒 | 30 天 | ✅ 已启用 |\n| **P2** | 数字量 (digital) | 周期采样 | 1 秒 | 30 天 | ✅ 已启用 |\n\n---\n\n### 2. 历史数据导出\n\n**P1（模拟量）** 最近 20 个采样点：\n```\n时间(s)  值\n  0      -0.4087\n  1      -0.2746\n  2      -0.1349\n  3       0.0076\n  4       0.1499\n  ...      ...\n 19       0.7502\n```\n\n**P2（数字量）** 最近 20 个采样点：\n```\n时间(s)  值\n  0      -0.2746\n  1      -0.1349\n  2       0.0076\n  ...      ...\n 19       0.6484\n```\n\n---\n\n### 说明\n- 两个点的历史采样已全部开启，后续数据会自动记录\n- 当前导出的是演示用的正弦波模拟数据\n- 保留周期默认 **30 天**，如需调整可以告诉我\n- 如果需要导出更长时间窗口或更多采样点，也可以随时告诉我\n\n还有其他需要调整的吗？", "reasoning": "Good, I've successfully:\n1. Listed all points (P1 and P2)\n2. Enabled history for both points\n3. Queried historical data for both points\n\nLet me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 258955, "output_tokens": 943, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 31966.15480002947}, "judge": null}
