-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64370, "output_tokens": 347, "latency_ms": 9531.378899991978, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "找到了\"chemical screen\"页面（ID: `chem_screen`）。现在我来添加 tank 和 button 控件：", "reasoning": "Found the \"chemical screen\" page with id \"chem_screen\". Now I need to:\n1. Create a tank widget on this page\n2. Bind the tank to TI-201\n3. Create a button widget for \"start\"\n\nI'll create the tank and button widgets. I need to choose positions and sizes. Let me place them reasonably.\n\nFor the tank, I'll put it on the left side, and for the button on the right side or below.\n\nLet me create both widgets first, then bind the tank to TI-201."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64780, "output_tokens": 125, "latency_ms": 3540.2192999608815, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个控件都已创建成功。现在将 tank 绑定到 **TI-201** 点位：", "reasoning": "Both widgets were created successfully. Now I need to bind the tank widget to the TI-201 tag. The tank widget typically has a \"value\" property that represents the level."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193373, "output_tokens": 568, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19911.987700033933}, "judge": null}
