 factory\n2. Export the history data\n\nLet me first list all existing points to see what's available, then I can enable history for each one.\n\nI should use list_points to get all points first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64408, "output_tokens": 209, "latency_ms": 7523.80369999446, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "当前项目中有 **2 个点位**：\n| 标签 | 类型 |\n|------|------|\n| P1 | analog（模拟量） |\n| P2 | digital（数字量） |\n\n我现在为这两个点都启用历史记录：", "reasoning": "There are 2 points: P1 (analog) and P2 (digital). Now I need to enable history for both of them. I can call enable_history for both in parallel since they are independent."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64686, "output_tokens": 195, "latency_ms": 6710.644400038291, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 历史记录已为 **P1** 和 **P2** 成功启用。\n\n现在我来查询这两个点的历史数据并导出：", "reasoning": "Both points now have history enabled. Let me verify by listing the history configuration, then query the history data and export it.\n\nActually, the user said \"导出来\" which means export. Let me first check what history data is available by querying it, then figure out how to export. Let me list the history configurations first."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193308, "output_tokens": 495, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23975.716900022235}, "judge": null}
