ng at the available tools, I see:\n- `query_history` - reads historical data\n- `export_report` - exports reports\n- `export_audit_trail` - exports audit trails\n\nThere's no direct \"export history\" tool. The closest would be `query_history` which reads historical data, or I could look at report templates to generate and export reports with historical data.\n\nActually, let me first enable history for both points, then figure out the export part.\n\nLet me enable history for both P1 and P2 in parallel."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128600, "output_tokens": 405, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14761.528400005773}, "judge": null}
