formation."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64513, "output_tokens": 348, "latency_ms": 12022.470599971712, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "找到了主画面（ID: `main`）。不过很抱歉，当前可用的工具中**没有\"复制页面\"功能**。\n\n目前页面相关的工具只支持：\n- ✅ **创建新页面**（空白页面）\n- ✅ **重命名页面**\n- ✅ **删除页面**\n\n但**不支持**：\n- ❌ 复制/克隆页面（包括页面上的组件和绑定）\n\n---\n\n**可选方案：**\n\n1. **手动重建**：我可以为您创建一个名为\"备用画面\"的新空白页面，然后您告诉我主画面上有哪些组件（如温度计、泵、趋势图等），我逐一帮您添加并绑定数据点。\n\n2. **等待工具更新**：后续版本可能会增加页面克隆功能。\n\n您希望采用哪种方式？如果选择方案1，请告诉我主画面上有哪些组件和点位绑定，我来帮您重建备用画面。", "reasoning": "I found the \"主画面\" (Main Page) with ID \"main\". However, looking at my available tools, I don't have a \"clone_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" function. I only have:\n\n- create_page - creates a new blank page\n- rename_page - renames an existing page\n- delete_page - deletes a page\n- list_pages - lists pages\n\nI cannot copy/clone a page with its widgets using the available tools. I should inform the user about this limitation and offer alternatives:\n\n1. Create a new blank page called \"备用画面\" (but this won't have the widgets from the main page)\n2. Explain that the current toolset doesn't support page duplication\n\nLet me be honest with the user about this limitation."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128724, "output_tokens": 600, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20846.782200038433}, "judge": null}
