面** | `pump_station` - 泵站画面 (1920×1080) |\n| **泵A图元** | `pump_a`，位置 (300, 400)，绑定点位 **PumpA** |\n| **泵B图元** | `pump_b`，位置 (700, 400)，绑定点位 **PumpB** |\n\n两个泵图元并排显示，运行时会根据 PumpA / PumpB 点位的实时值动态更新泵状态（启停、转速等）。如需添加文字标注、管道连线或调整布局，请告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All tasks completed successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 258847, "output_tokens": 926, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 27615.347199956886}, "judge": null}
