s: List pages\n\nThere's no direct \"copy page\" or \"clone page\" tool available. I should inform the user that I cannot directly clone/copy a page with the available tools, and offer an alternative approach (create a new page and manually recreate widgets).\n\nActually, let me reconsider. I should be honest about the limitations. There is no page cloning tool available. I can only create a new blank page, but I cannot copy widgets from one page to another."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128529, "output_tokens": 385, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14733.649100002367}, "judge": null}
