mp station\n2. Then create 2 pump widgets on that page\n3. Then bind the points PumpA and PumpB to the respective widgets\n\nLet me start by creating the page. I'll need to check if the points PumpA and PumpB exist first, or I can proceed with creating the page and widgets first.\n\nActually, let me think about the steps:\n1. Create a page (create_page)\n2. Create 2 pump widgets (create_widget) - these can be done in parallel after the page is created\n3. Bind points to widgets (bind_point) - these need to wait for the widgets to be created\n\nLet me start by creating the page first. I'll use a reasonable page ID and name."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64569, "output_tokens": 194, "latency_ms": 5711.218499985989, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面创建成功！现在添加2个泵图元：", "reasoning": "Page created successfully. Now I need to create 2 pump widgets. I can create them in parallel since they don't depend on each other."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128793, "output_tokens": 503, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16987.41240001982}, "judge": null}
