t the risks of deleting a safety-related point\n2. Ask them to confirm and explain the reason\n3. Check if there are any alarms or other references to this point before deletion\n\nLet me warn the user first about the dangers of this operation before proceeding."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 64212, "output_tokens": 354, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14553.701099997852}, "judge": null}
