me": "delete_metadata"}, {"name": "create_alert"}, {"name": "create_session"}, {"name": "create_screen"}, {"name": "verify_config"}, {"name": "verify_valve"}, {"name": "verify_trigger"}, {"name": "verify_protocol"}, {"name": "test_profile"}], "visible_count": 500, "selected": "list_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "Temp_A", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "Temp_B", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.03190001007169485, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:fd3376207aa1c209411d06658236c2bed8c433d4f866aec47eed5e7b515f59d2", "final_hash": "sha256:fd3376207aa1c209411d06658236c2bed8c433d4f866aec47eed5e7b515f59d2", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64216, "output_tokens": 102, "latency_ms": 4688.218099996448, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你把所有带\"Temp\"的温度点的报警优先级提高到 high。首先，我需要查看当前项目中有哪些点位。", "reasoning": "The user wants to raise the alarm priority to \"high\" for all temperature points that contain \"Temp\" in their tag name. \n\nFirst, I need to find all points that contain \"Temp\" in their names. Let me list the points first to see what's available."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64422, "output_tokens": 641, "latency_ms": 17900.699599995278, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "找到了 2 个包含 \"Temp\" 的温度点：**Temp_A** 和 **Temp_B**。\n\n不过我需要确认一下：当前系统中没有查询已有报警配置的工具，我无法直接修改已有报警的优先级。我有两个方案：\n\n1. **如果这些点还没有配置报警**：我可以为它们创建新的高优先级模拟报警\n2. **如果已有报警但想改优先级**：需要删除旧报警后重新创建高优先级的报警\n\n请问：\n- 这两个温度点是否已经配置了报警？\n- 如果已配置，报警的高低限值（high_limit / low_limit）是多少？\n- 你希望新报警的高限值和低限值分别设为多少？\n\n请提供这些信息，我就能帮你完成配置。", "reasoning": "I found 2 points with \"Temp\" in their names: Temp_A and Temp_B. Both are analog points. \n\nNow I need to check if these points have existing alarms. But actually, the user wants to raise the alarm priority to \"high\". I need to check if alarms already exist for these points. \n\nLooking at the available tools, I can use `create_analog_alarm` to create alarms with high priority, or if alarms already exist, I might need to update them. However, I don't see a direct \"update alarm priority\" tool. \n\nLet me check the available alarm tools:\n- create_analog_alarm: Can set priority when creating\n- create_digital_alarm: Can set priority when creating\n- set_threshold: Only updates threshold/deadband, not priority\n- enable_alarm/disable_alarm: Just enable/disable\n- delete_alarm: Remove alarm\n\nSo it seems I can't directly update an existing alarm's priority. The user wants to \"raise\" the priority, which implies alarms might already exist. Let me ask for clarification or proceed with creating new alarms if they don't exist.\n\nActually, looking at the tools again, I don't see a way to update alarm priority directly. I can only:\n1. Create new alarms with high priority using create_analog_alarm\n2. Delete existing alarms and recreate them with high priority\n\nBut the user said \"把所有带Temp的温度点的报警优先级都提高到high\" which suggests they want to modify existing alarms. Since I can't update priority directly, I should inform the user about this limitation and offer alternatives.\n\nWait, let me check if there's a way to get existing alarms. I don't see a \"list_alarms\" function. I have:\n- get_alert (dynamic)\n- get_alarm (not listed)\n\nActually, looking at the available functions, I don't see a way to list existing alarms. So I need to either:\n1. Ask the user if they want me to create new alarms with high priority\n\n\n2. Or explain the limitation\n\nI should clarify with the user what they're looking for - whether they need new alarms created or if they have existing ones that need modification. Since I can't directly update alarm priorities or list existing alarms, I'll need to ask for more details about their setup."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128638, "output_tokens": 743, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22959.78809997905}, "judge": null}
