: "delete_metadata"}, {"name": "create_alert"}, {"name": "create_session"}, {"name": "create_screen"}, {"name": "verify_config"}, {"name": "verify_valve"}, {"name": "verify_trigger"}, {"name": "verify_protocol"}, {"name": "test_profile"}], "visible_count": 500, "selected": "list_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "p1", "name": "页面1"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.020400038920342922, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:312befcef3bd35cdc7290e5c0022e0d1e38927b9b62d134974a6c9238000bebd", "final_hash": "sha256:312befcef3bd35cdc7290e5c0022e0d1e38927b9b62d134974a6c9238000bebd", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64217, "output_tokens": 130, "latency_ms": 4843.550799996592, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先查看一下项目中现有的页面和图元信息，然后再帮你操作。\n\n让我先列出所有页面：", "reasoning": "The user is asking to move widgets from page 1 to page 2, and also add a background image. Let me first understand what pages and widgets exist in the project.\n\nI need to:\n1. List all pages to find the page IDs for \"page 1\" and \"page 2\"\n2. Get the widgets on page 1 to understand what needs to be moved\n\nLet me start by listing pages to get the actual page IDs."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64398, "output_tokens": 710, "latency_ms": 21101.273600012064, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中**只有一个页面**——\"页面1\"（ID: `p1`），还没有\"页面2\"。\n\n另外，我需要向您说明几个情况：\n\n1. **移动图元**：当前系统没有直接的\"移动图元\"功能。需要先在新页面上重新创建相同的图元，然后删除旧页面上的图元，再重新绑定数据点。这涉及到重建工作。\n\n2. **背景图**：创建页面时可以设置背景颜色（如 `#FFFFFF`），但设置**背景图片**的功能在当前工具集中未直接提供。\n\n为了帮您操作，我需要确认以下信息：\n\n- **页面2**：您希望页面2叫什么名字？分辨率和背景色有要求吗？\n- **图元**：页面1上目前有哪些图元（如泵、阀门、温度计等）？如果您能告诉我，我可以在页面2上重新创建它们。\n- **背景图**：您指的\"背景图\"是背景颜色还是需要上传一张图片？如果是图片，当前系统可能不支持直接上传。\n\n请告诉我您的具体需求，我来帮您一步步完成！", "reasoning": "OK, so there's only one page currently - \"页面1\" (p1). There's no \"页面2\" yet. I need to:\n\n1. Create a new page \"页面2\"\n2. Then move widgets from page 1 to page 2\n\nBut wait - the user mentioned moving widgets from page 1 to page 2, but there's no page 2 yet. Also, I need to see what widgets are on page 1.\n\nLet me also think about the background image - the user wants to add a background to one of the pages. The `create_page` function has a `background` parameter, but it's a string (likely a color code). There's no direct \"set background image\" tool available.\n\nAlso, there's no direct \"move widget\" tool. The tools available are:\n- `create_widget` - to create a widget on a page\n- `delete_widget` - to delete a widget from a page\n- `bind_point` - to bind a point to a widget\n\nThere's no \"move_widget\" function. So I would need to:\n1. Get the widgets on page 1\n2. Create new widgets on page 2 with the same properties\n3. Delete the old widgets from page 1\n4. Rebind any points\n\nBut I can't directly \"get\" widgets from a page to know their properties. Let me check if there's a way... The `get_widget` function exists but it's a \"Dynamic\" function with no clear parameters.\n\nActually, looking at the available tools more carefully, I don't see a direct way to list widgets on a page or move widgets between pages. This is a limitation.\n\nLet me be honest with the user about what's possible and what's not:\n1. I can create a new page \"页面2\" with a background\n2. I cannot directly \"move\" widgets - there's no move function\n\n\n3. I'd need to recreate them on the new page, but without knowing their current properties this becomes tricky. The `get_widget` function might help retrieve widget details if I can call it properly, though it seems to require specific parameters I'm not certain about.\n\nLet me explain this situation to the user and ask for clarification on what they need."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128615, "output_tokens": 840, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 26286.22369997902}, "judge": null}
