gger"}, {"name": "verify_protocol"}, {"name": "test_profile"}], "visible_count": 500, "selected": "deploy_project", "action": "deploy_project", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "deployed"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default.status": "deployed"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.028499984182417393, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:b4e9ca24449222d7d2b092ac56a9ed4edf5fbd4891c75537d78e0fe29ecb2a5d", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64237, "output_tokens": 502, "latency_ms": 13065.678599989042, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我来为您创建一个完整的反应釜综合监控方案。我将分步完成：\n\n1. **新建画面** - 反应釜监控页面\n2. **建三个点位** - 温度、压力、液位\n3. **绑点到控件** - 罐子和仪表\n4. **验证并下发**\n\n首先，我们同时创建画面和三个点位：", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a comprehensive reactor monitoring solution. Let me break down their requirements:\n\n1. Create a new HMI page (画面)\n2. Create three SCADA points: temperature (温度), pressure (压力), level (液位)\n3. Bind these points to widgets on the page (tank and instruments)\n4. Validate and deploy\n\nLet me start by:\n1. Creating the HMI page\n2. Creating the three points (analog type with appropriate units)\n\nI can do the page creation and point creation in parallel since they don't depend on each other."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64867, "output_tokens": 920, "latency_ms": 13700.985200004652, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "画面和三个点位创建成功！接下来我们在画面上放置控件：一个反应釜罐体、温度计、压力表、液位计，以及标题文字。", "reasoning": "All four items created successfully. Now I need to create widgets on the page:\n1. A tank widget for the reactor vessel\n2. A thermometer for temperature\n3. A pressure gauge for pressure\n4. A level indicator for level\n5. Some text labels for identification\n\nLet me create these widgets and then bind the points to them."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66077, "output_tokens": 353, "latency_ms": 8384.984700009227, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "控件全部创建完成！现在将三个点位绑定到对应的控件上：", "reasoning": "All widgets created. Now I need to bind the points to the widgets:\n1. REACTOR_TEMP_01 → temp_gauge (value)\n2. REACTOR_PRESS_01 → press_gauge (value)\n3. REACTOR_LEVEL_01 → level_indicator (value)\n4. REACTOR_LEVEL_01 → reactor_tank_01 (value/level)\n\nLet me make these bindings."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66584, "output_tokens": 57, "latency_ms": 2704.813299991656, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "绑定全部完成！现在进行项目验证：", "reasoning": "All bindings are done. Now I need to validate the project and then deploy it. Let me run validation first."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66684, "output_tokens": 39, "latency_ms": 2695.091000001412, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "验证通过，零错误！现在执行下发部署：", "reasoning": "Validation passed with no errors. Now I can deploy the project."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66763, "output_tokens": 440, "latency_ms": 11090.514199982863, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **反应釜综合监控方案 — 全部完成！**\n\n---\n\n### 📋 完成清单\n\n| 步骤 | 内容 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **画面** | `reactor_monitor` — 反应釜综合监控（1920×1080，深色背景） | ✅ |\n| **温度点** | `REACTOR_TEMP_01` — 模拟量，-20~500°C | ✅ |\n| **压力点** | `REACTOR_PRESS_01` — 模拟量，0~10 MPa | ✅ |\n| **液位点** | `REACTOR_LEVEL_01` — 模拟量，0~100% | ✅ |\n| **罐体控件** | `reactor_tank_01` — 绑定液位 | ✅ |\n| **温度计** | `temp_gauge` — 绑定温度 | ✅ |\n| **压力表** | `press_gauge` — 绑定压力 | ✅ |\n| **液位计** | `level_indicator` — 绑定液位 | ✅ |\n| **项目验证** | 零错误通过 | ✅ |\n| **项目部署** | 已下发到生产环境 | ✅ |\n\n### 🔗 绑定关系\n```\ntemp_gauge.value      ← REACTOR_TEMP_01   (温度计显示反应釜温度)\npress_gauge.value     ← REACTOR_PRESS_01  (压力表显示反应釜压力)\nlevel_indicator.value ← REACTOR_LEVEL_01  (液位计显示反应釜液位)\nreactor_tank_01.level ← REACTOR_LEVEL_01  (罐体动画跟随液位变化)\n```\n\n画面已部署就绪，操作员可以在 HMI 上实时查看反应釜的温度、压力和液位数据。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Deployment successful! Let me summarize what was accomplished."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 395212, "output_tokens": 2311, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 52763.20810004836}, "judge": null}
