 "verify_driver"}, {"name": "test_setting"}, {"name": "create_notification_rule"}, {"name": "configure_notification_channel"}, {"name": "add_escalation_level"}, {"name": "test_notification"}, {"name": "list_notification_rules"}, {"name": "get_connection"}, {"name": "get_token"}, {"name": "get_layout"}, {"name": "set_cache"}, {"name": "set_sensor"}, {"name": "set_restore"}, {"name": "set_panel"}, {"name": "update_parameter"}, {"name": "update_pump"}, {"name": "update_schedule"}, {"name": "update_gateway"}, {"name": "delete_policy"}, {"name": "delete_vessel"}, {"name": "delete_batch"}, {"name": "delete_metadata"}, {"name": "create_alert"}, {"name": "create_session"}, {"name": "create_screen"}, {"name": "verify_config"}, {"name": "verify_valve"}, {"name": "verify_trigger"}, {"name": "verify_protocol"}, {"name": "test_profile"}], "visible_count": 500, "selected": "create_analog_alarm", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_pump_01_low_flow", "tag": "PUMP_01_FLOW", "high_limit": "500", "low_limit": "10", "deadband": 2, "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "ALREADY_EXISTS", "error_msg": "alarm alarm_pump_01_low_flow already exists", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.0149000552482903, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_pump_01_low_flow"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PUMP_01_FLOW"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64221, "output_tokens": 601, "latency_ms": 13991.905200004112, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我来帮你搭建一个完整的泵站控制台，包括点位、HMI页面、控件和报警。先创建基础点位和页面。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a pump station control console with start/stop controls and alarms. Let me break this down:\n\n1. Need to create SCADA points for the pump (status, start/stop command, maybe speed/current)\n2. Create an HMI page for the pump station console\n3. Add widgets (pump, buttons, indicators)\n4. Bind points to widgets\n5. Create alarms\n\nLet me start by creating the necessary points and the page. I'll need:\n- PUMP_STATUS (digital - running/stopped)\n- PUMP_CMD (digital - start/stop command)\n- PUMP_SPEED (analog - speed in RPM)\n- PUMP_CURRENT (analog - motor current)\n- Maybe PUMP_FLOW (analog - flow rate)\n\nThen create an HMI page and widgets.\n\nLet me make the independent calls first - create points and create the page."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65010, "output_tokens": 1004, "latency_ms": 21023.939799983054, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位和页面都创建好了。接下来添加控件——泵体、启停按钮、仪表盘和状态指示灯：", "reasoning": "Points and page created successfully. Now let me add the widgets to the page - pump widget, indicators, buttons, gauges, etc."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66240, "output_tokens": 849, "latency_ms": 18860.928700014483, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "控件全部创建完成。现在添加标题和标注文字，然后绑定点位：", "reasoning": "Good, all widgets created. Now let me add text labels for the gauges, a title, and bind points to widgets."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 67503, "output_tokens": 360, "latency_ms": 5708.857399993576, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "绑定完成！最后一步——创建报警，包括过流报警、超速报警和故障报警：", "reasoning": "Now let me create the alarms. I need:\n1. High current alarm (overcurrent protection)\n2. High speed alarm\n3. Digital alarm for pump fault\n\nLet me create these alarms now."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 68025, "output_tokens": 267, "latency_ms": 8607.450800016522, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "数字报警创建成功，模拟量报警的 null 值需要调整，重试一下：", "reasoning": "I need to fix the null values - I should just not include those parameters or pass null differently. Let me retry without the null limits."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 68422, "output_tokens": 292, "latency_ms": 5133.758100040723, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "明白了，需要同时提供高低限值。调整参数再试：", "reasoning": "The schema seems to require both high_limit and low_limit as numbers (not null). Let me provide both as numbers for each alarm."}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 68844, "output_tokens": 341, "latency_ms": 6039.689500001259, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我再调整格式试一下：", "reasoning": "Hmm, still getting schema errors. This might be a validation issue with how the tool processes the parameters. Let me try with different formatting - maybe the issue is with how I'm passing numbers. Let me try with explicit float values."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 468265, "output_tokens": 3714, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 82276.4959000051}, "judge": null}
