_flow", "tag": "DEMO_FLOW_401", "color": "#FF8800", "line_width": 2, "y_axis": "right"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"pen_id": "pen_flow", "added": true}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.009200011845678091, "intended_entities": ["trends.DEMO_Trends.pens.pen_flow"], "referenced_entities": ["trends.DEMO_Trends", "points.DEMO_FLOW_401"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:f9dae10b3300b2abf0ff49e18d53fa6c17d56f59bb96c05298037fc312ecbffb", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64220, "output_tokens": 610, "latency_ms": 15351.224499987438, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来帮你搭建一个完整的演示场景：先创建几个假点位，然后配上高低报警，最后开个趋势图看它们。\n\n先创建 4 个模拟量点位：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Create fake/non-existent points\n2. Set up high/low alarms on them\n3. Create a trend view to monitor them\n\nThis seems like a reasonable SCADA configuration request. The user wants to set up some test/demo points with alarms and trend monitoring. Let me help them do this.\n\nFirst, I need to create the points, then create alarms on those points, and then set up trend visualization.\n\nLet me start by creating some analog points. I'll create a few demo points first.\n\nLet me ask the user for some specifics - or I could just create a reasonable set of demo points. The user said \"假点位\" (fake points) and \"一大堆高低报\" (a bunch of high/low alarms), so they want me to create multiple points with alarms.\n\nLet me create some demo analog points first, then add alarms to them.\n\nI'll create a few points:\n- TEMP_101 (temperature)\n- PRESS_201 (pressure)\n- LEVEL_301 (level)\n- FLOW_401 (flow)\n\nThen create high/low alarms for each, then set up a trend group.\n\nLet me start with creating the points."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64961, "output_tokens": 645, "latency_ms": 8907.537499966566, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "4 个假点位创建完毕！现在给每个点位配高低报警（共 8 个报警）：", "reasoning": "All 4 points created successfully. Now let me create high/low alarms for each point. I'll create both high and low alarms for each, totaling 8 alarms."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65869, "output_tokens": 134, "latency_ms": 4561.306399991736, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "8 个报警全部配好！现在开趋势图，把 4 条曲线全加进去：", "reasoning": "All 8 alarms created successfully. Now let me set up the trend group to visualize these points. I'll create a trend group and add pens for each of the 4 points."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66044, "output_tokens": 344, "latency_ms": 8304.325300035998, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "Now let me add the 4 trend pens to the group."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66523, "output_tokens": 650, "latency_ms": 15827.315300004557, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部搞定！来看看搭建的成果清单：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 演示场景总览\n\n### 🏷️ 4 个假点位\n| 点位标签 | 类型 | 工程单位 | 量程 |\n|---------|------|---------|------|\n| `DEMO_TEMP_101` | 模拟量 | °C | -20 ~ 200 |\n| `DEMO_PRESS_201` | 模拟量 | bar | 0 ~ 25 |\n| `DEMO_LEVEL_301` | 模拟量 | % | 0 ~ 100 |\n| `DEMO_FLOW_401` | 模拟量 | m³/h | 0 ~ 500 |\n\n### 🚨 8 个高低报警\n| 报警ID | 监控点位 | 限值 | 优先级 | 死区 |\n|--------|---------|------|--------|------|\n| `alarm_temp_101_high` | 温度 | >150°C | 🔴高 | 2 |\n| `alarm_temp_101_low` | 温度 | <5°C | 🟡中 | 1 |\n| `alarm_press_201_high` | 压力 | >18 bar | 🔴高 | 0.5 |\n| `alarm_press_201_low` | 压力 | <2 bar | 🟡中 | 0.2 |\n| `alarm_level_301_high` | 液位 | >90% | 🔴高 | 1 |\n| `alarm_level_301_low` | 液位 | <15% | 🔴高 | 1 |\n| `alarm_flow_401_high` | 流量 | >400 m³/h | 🟡中 | 10 |\n| `alarm_flow_401_low` | 流量 | <30 m³/h | 🟢低 | 5 |\n\n### 📈 趋势图 `DEMO_Trends`\n| 曲线 | 颜色 | Y轴 |\n|------|------|-----|\n| 🔴 温度 | 红色 | 左轴 |\n| 🔵 压力 | 蓝色 | 左轴 |\n| 🟢 液位 | 绿色 | 右轴 |\n| 🟠 流量 | 橙色 | 右轴 |\n\n> 双 Y 轴设计：左轴是温度/压力，右轴是液位/流量，避免量程差异太大看不清。\n\n这些都是纯配置的假点位，没有实际数据源驱动。如果你想看趋势图上有演示波形跑起来，可以让我给它们开历史采样，系统会生成正弦波模拟数据。需要吗？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Everything is set up. Let me summarize what was created for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 327617, "output_tokens": 2383, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 53821.69710000744}, "judge": null}
