*页面 ID** | `sewage_station_overview` |\n| **分辨率** | 1920 × 1080 |\n| **背景色** | #000000（纯黑） |\n\n**已放置的组件：**\n\n| 组件 | Widget ID | 位置 | 说明 |\n|------|-----------|------|------|\n| 标题 | `title_label` | (560, 40) | \"污水泵站总览\"，白色加粗，36号字 |\n| 1#泵 | `pump_1` | (350, 300) | 300×300 泵占位 |\n| 2#泵 | `pump_2` | (1100, 300) | 300×300 泵占位 |\n\n---\n\n**后续可以做的事情：**\n- 绑定点位：将实际泵标签（如 `PUMP_1_STATUS`）绑定到泵控件属性\n- 添加更多组件：液位计、管道、阀门、趋势图等\n- 配置报警：为泵状态添加报警规则\n\n需要继续配置吗？", "reasoning": "All widgets created successfully. Let me summarize what was created for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193920, "output_tokens": 1031, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 28677.714699995704}, "judge": null}
