ng it to update the page.\n\nWait, actually I should use `set_widget_style` for widgets on a page, but for the page itself, I need to look for page update capabilities. I don't see a direct \"update_page\" function in the list.\n\nLet me look again... I see:\n- create_page\n- rename_page\n- delete_page\n\nThere's no explicit update_page for resolution and background. However, there's `update_screen` which is a dynamic tool. This might work for updating page properties.\n\nLet me try using `update_screen` to change the resolution and background of the page."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64750, "output_tokens": 193, "latency_ms": 6087.884499982465, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "页面修改完成！✅\n\n**main_overview 页面已更新：**\n\n| 属性 | 修改前 | 修改后 |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| 分辨率 | 默认 (1920×1080) | **4K (3840×2160)** |\n| 背景色 | 默认 (#FFFFFF) | **深蓝色 (#0A1929)** |\n| 原有图元 | - | **全部保留** |\n\n> 💡 提示：改为4K分辨率后，原有图元在大屏幕上可能会显得偏小，如需调整图元大小或重新布局，可以随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "The update was successful. The page \"main_overview\" has been updated to 4K resolution (3840x2160) with a deep blue background (#0A1929), while keeping all existing widgets."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193326, "output_tokens": 648, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22121.648400032427}, "judge": null}
