ey're independent of each other, I can make all calls at once."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64847, "output_tokens": 268, "latency_ms": 6923.693199991249, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已成功创建 **5 个传感器点位**，详情如下：\n\n| 点位标签 | 类型 | 工程单位 | 量程 | 说明 |\n|---------|------|---------|------|------|\n| `TEMP_101` | 模拟量 | °C | -40 ~ 200 | 反应釜温度传感器 |\n| `PRESS_201` | 模拟量 | MPa | 0 ~ 10 | 管道压力传感器 |\n| `LEVEL_301` | 模拟量 | % | 0 ~ 100 | 储罐液位传感器 |\n| `FLOW_401` | 模拟量 | m³/h | 0 ~ 500 | 管道流量传感器 |\n| `PUMP_RUN_01` | 开关量 | — | — | 1号泵运行状态 |\n\n这些点位涵盖了工业现场最常见的温度、压力、液位、流量四大工艺参数，以及设备运行状态信号。如果需要调整量程、添加报警或配置历史记录，随时告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All 5 sensor points have been created successfully. Let me summarize what was created for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 129058, "output_tokens": 751, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20297.357900009956}, "judge": null}
