, "visible_count": 500, "selected": "create_point", "action": "create_point", "args": {"tag": "TEMP_101", "type": "analog", "unit": "°C", "min": "0", "max": "200", "description": "温度传感器 101"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"tag": "TEMP_101"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"points.TEMP_101": {"tag": "TEMP_101", "type": "analog", "unit": "°C", "min": 0.0, "max": 200.0, "description": "温度传感器 101"}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.08680002065375447, "intended_entities": ["points.TEMP_101"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64211, "output_tokens": 92, "latency_ms": 8766.793600050732, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要帮用户创建一些传感器点。用户要求\"加几个传感器点\"，但没有具体说明数量、类型或名称。我需要先了解现有的点位情况，然后决定创建哪些传感器点。\n\n首先，我应该列出所有现有的点位，了解项目当前状态，然后创建几个合理的传感器点。我可以先调用 list_points 查看现有点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64340, "output_tokens": 269, "latency_ms": 10200.205600005575, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在没有现有点位。我需要创建几个传感器点。用户说\"名字类型你决定\"，所以我可以创建一些常见的工业传感器点。我应该考虑不同的类型：模拟量（温度、压力、流量）、数字量（阀门状态、泵状态）、字符串（设备名称）。\n\n让我创建5个传感器点：\n1. TEMP_101 - 温度传感器，模拟量，单位°C，范围0-200\n2. PRESS_201 - 压力传感器，模拟量，单位bar，范围0-10\n3. FLOW_301 - 流量传感器，模拟量，单位m³/h，范围0-100\n4. VALVE_01_STATUS - 阀门状态，数字量\n5. PUMP_01_STATUS - 泵状态，数字量\n\n我将依次创建这些点。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128551, "output_tokens": 361, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21227.762900001835}, "judge": null}
