n the same block.\n\nFor the alarm IDs, I'll use descriptive names like:\n- alarm_pt_comp_01_high\n- alarm_pt_comp_01_high_high\n\nBoth alarms will monitor the same tag PT_COMP_01, but with different high limits and priorities."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64594, "output_tokens": 194, "latency_ms": 6950.063699972816, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已完成 PT_COMP_01 的报警配置，两个报警均已成功创建：\n\n| 报警 ID | 点位 | 报警限值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|------|----------|--------|\n| `alarm_PT_COMP_01_H` | PT_COMP_01 | H = 2.8 | medium |\n| `alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH` | PT_COMP_01 | HH = 3.2 | high |\n\n当前配置为：\n- 当 PT_COMP_01 ≥ **2.8** 时触发 **H 报警**（中优先级）\n- 当 PT_COMP_01 ≥ **3.2** 时触发 **HH 报警**（高优先级）\n\n如需设置死区（deadband）或添加 LL/L 低限报警，请告诉我。", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128820, "output_tokens": 490, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18560.953799984418}, "judge": null}
