 high_limit: 2.8\n- priority: medium\n\nSecond alarm:\n- id: alarm_pt_comp_01_hh\n- tag: PT_COMP_01\n- high_limit: 3.2\n- priority: high\n\nThese two calls are independent, so I can make them in the same block."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64632, "output_tokens": 176, "latency_ms": 6379.856799961999, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "PT_COMP_01 的两个报警已成功配置，汇总如下：\n\n| 报警 ID | 报警类型 | 触发限值 | 优先级 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `alarm_pt_comp_01_h` | H（高） | ≥ 2.8 | medium（中） |\n| `alarm_pt_comp_01_hh` | HH（高高） | ≥ 3.2 | high（高） |\n\n当 PT_COMP_01 的值达到 **2.8** 时触发中优先级高报警，达到 **3.2** 时触发高优先级高高报警。如需设置死区（deadband）或低限报警，可以随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the configuration for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128858, "output_tokens": 510, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19341.274100006558}, "judge": null}
