"name": "delete_metadata"}, {"name": "create_alert"}, {"name": "create_session"}, {"name": "create_screen"}, {"name": "verify_config"}, {"name": "verify_valve"}, {"name": "verify_trigger"}, {"name": "verify_protocol"}, {"name": "test_profile"}], "visible_count": 500, "selected": "create_digital_alarm", "action": "create_digital_alarm", "args": {"id": "alarm_pump_a_run_lost", "tag": "PUMP_A_RUN", "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_pump_a_run_lost"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_pump_a_run_lost": {"id": "alarm_pump_a_run_lost", "tag": "PUMP_A_RUN", "type": "digital", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.069500005338341, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_pump_a_run_lost"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PUMP_A_RUN"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:49df93da0fe09d5b9e3296b4d375e05347a8a93f8cca600dd60317c39758fc8f", "final_hash": "sha256:5a553e06abce005f776e348b623040f8d7e249a5fb604cb9cd80f6f04dc71897", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64215, "output_tokens": 625, "latency_ms": 16194.802799960598, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来为 PUMP_A_RUN 创建一个数字报警。\n\nPUMP_A_RUN 是一个运行反馈信号（数字量点），当该信号消失（变为 false）时表示泵停止运行。不过需要注意的是，当前的数字报警工具是当标签变为 **true** 时触发报警。如果您的系统中\"运行反馈消失\"对应的是 PUMP_A_RUN 变为 false，建议使用取反逻辑的标签（如 PUMP_A_NOT_RUN）来创建报警，或者我先基于现有工具为您创建报警。\n\n我先创建报警：", "reasoning": "The user wants to create an alarm for PUMP_A_RUN point. They want to create an alarm when the running feedback disappears, with high priority.\n\nPUMP_A_RUN is likely a digital point that indicates whether a pump is running (true = running, false = stopped). The user wants an alarm when the feedback disappears, which means when the tag becomes false (not running).\n\nFor a digital alarm that fires when a boolean tag becomes true, I need to use `create_digital_alarm`. But wait - the user wants the alarm when the feedback \"disappears\" (i.e., when the pump stops running, which would be when PUMP_A_RUN becomes false).\n\nHowever, looking at the `create_digital_alarm` function description: \"Create a digital alarm that fires when a boolean tag becomes true.\" This fires when the tag becomes true, not false.\n\nSo if PUMP_A_RUN is true when running and false when stopped, I need the alarm to fire when it becomes false. But the tool fires when it becomes true.\n\nThere are a few approaches:\n1. I could create the alarm but note this limitation to the user\n2. The user might have a separate tag like PUMP_A_STOP or the tag might be inverted logic\n\nActually, let me reconsider. In many SCADA systems, \"运行反馈消失\" could mean:\n- The feedback signal is lost (becomes false)\n- There might be a separate tag for alarm state\n\nGiven the tool only fires when the tag becomes true, I have two options:\n1. Explain to the user that the tool creates an alarm when the tag becomes TRUE, and ask if they have an inverted tag or if they want to adjust\n2. Just proceed and note the behavior\n\nLet me proceed with creating the digital alarm. The user might expect that \"运行反馈消失\" means they want to be alerted when PUMP_A_RUN becomes false (pump stops unexpectedly). The standard `create_digital_alarm` fires when the tag becomes true.\n\n\nI should create the alarm using the available tool and clarify the behavior to the user - the alarm will trigger when the tag transitions to true, so if they need notification when the feedback disappears (becomes false), they may need to adjust their tag logic or use an inverted signal."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64878, "output_tokens": 266, "latency_ms": 10205.965499975719, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "报警已成功创建！配置详情如下：\n\n| 项目 | 配置 |\n|------|------|\n| **报警 ID** | `alarm_pump_a_run_lost` |\n| **监控点位** | `PUMP_A_RUN` |\n| **报警类型** | 数字量报警 |\n| **优先级** | high（高） |\n| **触发条件** | PUMP_A_RUN 变为 true 时触发 |\n\n⚠️ **重要提醒：**\n当前数字报警工具是在标签变为 **true** 时触发。如果您的需求是\"运行反馈消失\"（即 PUMP_A_RUN 从 true 变为 false 时报警），您有两种处理方式：\n\n1. **创建取反标签**：新建一个点位（如 `PUMP_A_NOT_RUN`），通过脚本将其设为 `NOT PUMP_A_RUN`，然后对该取反标签配置报警\n2. **通过脚本实现**：创建一个 `on_change` 脚本，检测 PUMP_A_RUN 变为 false 时触发报警逻辑\n\n请问您需要我帮您用哪种方式来正确实现\"反馈消失报警\"的功能？", "reasoning": "The alarm was created successfully. Let me inform the user about the result and the behavior of the alarm."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 129093, "output_tokens": 891, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 26765.48790000379}, "judge": null}
