ith name \"泵面板\". Now I need to create a pump widget on this page. I'll create the pump widget and then bind the two points to it.\n\nLet me create the pump widget first. I'll need to choose a widget_id, position, and size."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64601, "output_tokens": 199, "latency_ms": 7171.097600017674, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵A图元创建成功！现在绑定点位。", "reasoning": "Good, the pump widget was created. Now I need to bind the two points:\n1. Running status (运行状态) → PUMP_A_RUN → probably bind to \"running\" or \"status\" property\n2. Frequency (频率) → PUMP_A_HZ → probably bind to \"frequency\" or \"speed\" property\n\nLet me bind both properties now."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64872, "output_tokens": 200, "latency_ms": 7342.212499992456, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 泵A图元配置完成！汇总如下：\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **画面** | pump_panel（泵面板） |\n| **图元ID** | pump_a |\n| **图元类型** | pump（泵） |\n| **位置** | (200, 200)，尺寸 160×160 |\n\n**点位绑定：**\n| 属性 | 绑定Tag | 说明 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `running` | **PUMP_A_RUN** | 泵A运行状态 |\n| `frequency` | **PUMP_A_HZ** | 泵A运行频率 |\n\n现在在pump_panel画面中可以看到泵A图元，并实时显示其运行状态和频率。如需调整位置、样式或添加更多点位绑定，请告诉我。", "reasoning": "All bindings were successful. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 258105, "output_tokens": 686, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 27253.5712000099}, "judge": null}
