", "text": "找到了\"pump_panel\"页面。现在我来添加泵A图元，并绑定相应的点位。", "reasoning": "Good, the page \"pump_panel\" exists. Now I need to:\n1. Create a pump widget on this page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the running status property\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the frequency property\n\nLet me create the pump widget first. I'll use a meaningful widget_id like \"pump_a\" and position it reasonably on the page."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64660, "output_tokens": 198, "latency_ms": 7261.488699994516, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵A图元已添加成功！现在绑定运行状态和频率点位：", "reasoning": "The pump widget has been created. Now I need to bind the two SCADA points to the widget properties:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN -> running status (likely \"running\" or \"status\" property)\n2. PUMP_A_HZ -> frequency (likely \"frequency\" or \"speed\" property)\n\nLet me bind both points now."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193333, "output_tokens": 544, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20019.864300033078}, "judge": null}
