sts, and the two points PUMP_A_RUN (digital) and PUMP_A_HZ (analog) also exist. Now I need to:\n\n1. Create a pump widget on the pump_panel page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the pump's status/running property\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the pump's frequency property\n\nLet me create the pump widget first, then bind the points."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 128759, "output_tokens": 408, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 17971.202399989124}, "judge": null}
