n": "tool_use", "text": "页面\"pump_panel\"（泵面板）已存在。现在我来添加泵A图元并绑定点位。", "reasoning": "The page \"pump_panel\" exists. Now I need to:\n1. Create a pump widget on the \"pump_panel\" page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the running status property\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the frequency property\n\nLet me create the pump widget first."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64600, "output_tokens": 177, "latency_ms": 4987.317499995697, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵A图元已创建成功。现在绑定两个点位：", "reasoning": "Good, the pump widget was created. Now I need to bind the two points:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN to the running status (run/status property)\n2. PUMP_A_HZ to the frequency property\n\nLet me make both binding calls."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64849, "output_tokens": 174, "latency_ms": 5719.36149999965, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **泵A图元配置完成！** 以下是操作摘要：\n\n| 操作 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面** | pump_panel（泵面板） |\n| **图元** | `pump_a`（泵类型，位置 200,200，尺寸 150×150） |\n| **运行状态绑定** | `pump_a.run` ← `PUMP_A_RUN` |\n| **频率绑定** | `pump_a.frequency` ← `PUMP_A_HZ` |\n\n泵A图元已在pump_panel画面中创建，并成功绑定了运行状态和频率两个点位。如需调整位置、样式或其他属性，请告知。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All three operations completed successfully. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 258055, "output_tokens": 637, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23445.905600034166}, "judge": null}
