n": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64461, "output_tokens": 300, "latency_ms": 8078.599000000395, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面 `pump_panel`（泵面板）已存在。现在添加泵A图元并绑定两个点位。\n\n**第二步：创建泵图元 + 绑定点位**", "reasoning": "The page \"pump_panel\" exists with name \"泵面板\". Now I need to:\n1. Create a pump widget on this page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the running status property\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the frequency property\n\nLet me create the pump widget first. I'll use a reasonable position and size for the pump widget."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64861, "output_tokens": 209, "latency_ms": 7067.856099980418, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部配置完成 ✅，汇总如下：\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | `pump_panel`（泵面板） |\n| **图元 ID** | `pump_A`（泵图元） |\n| **位置** | (100, 150)，尺寸 120×120 |\n| **绑定 ①** | `pump_A.running` ← **PUMP_A_RUN**（运行状态） |\n| **绑定 ②** | `pump_A.frequency` ← **PUMP_A_HZ**（频率） |\n\n现在泵A图元已在画面中就绪，运行时会实时读取：\n- **PUMP_A_RUN** 控制泵的运行/停止动画状态\n- **PUMP_A_HZ** 显示当前频率值\n\n如需调整位置、大小或样式，随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "All three operations succeeded. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 193549, "output_tokens": 691, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21867.324499995448}, "judge": null}
