et me first check if the page \"chem_panel\" exists by listing pages."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64396, "output_tokens": 201, "latency_ms": 7368.331700039562, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面 `chem_panel`（化工面板）已存在。现在我在该页面上创建一个罐体（tank）组件。", "reasoning": "The page \"chem_panel\" exists with the name \"化工面板\". Now I need to:\n1. Create a tank widget on this page\n2. Bind LT_01 to the level property\n3. Bind TT_01 to the temperature property\n4. Bind PT_01 to the pressure property\n\nLet me create the tank widget first. I'll use a reasonable position and size for the tank."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64635, "output_tokens": 313, "latency_ms": 8456.90220000688, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体组件创建成功！现在绑定三个数据点：液位(LT_01)、温度(TT_01)、压力(PT_01)。", "reasoning": "Good, the tank widget was created. Now I need to bind the three points:\n- LT_01 → level (液位)\n- TT_01 → temperature (温度)\n- PT_01 → pressure (压力)\n\nThese bindings are independent of each other, so I can make all three calls at once."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65064, "output_tokens": 201, "latency_ms": 6705.154300027061, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部配置完成！以下是汇总：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面** | `chem_panel`（化工面板） |\n| **组件** | `tank_reactor_01`（罐体），位置 (400, 200)，尺寸 200×300 |\n| **液位绑定** | `tank_reactor_01.level` ← `LT_01` ✅ |\n| **温度绑定** | `tank_reactor_01.temperature` ← `TT_01` ✅ |\n| **压力绑定** | `tank_reactor_01.pressure` ← `PT_01` ✅ |\n\n罐体现在会在 HMI 面板上实时显示这三个工艺参数。如需调整罐体的位置、大小、样式，或配置相关报警，随时告诉我。", "reasoning": "All three bindings were successful. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 258326, "output_tokens": 829, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 28108.032000018284}, "judge": null}
