"tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查看一下当前项目中所有的点位，然后再为它们逐一启用历史记录。\n\n让我先列出所有点位：", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Enable history for all existing points in the factory\n2. Export the history data\n\nLet me first list all existing points to see what's available, then enable history for each one.\n\nLet me start by listing all points to understand what we're working with."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64418, "output_tokens": 212, "latency_ms": 6371.955500000013, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "当前项目中共有 **2 个点位**：\n| 点位 | 类型 |\n|------|------|\n| P1 | 模拟量 (analog) |\n| P2 | 数字量 (digital) |\n\n接下来我为这两个点位都启用历史记录：", "reasoning": "There are 2 points in the project:\n1. P1 (analog)\n2. P2 (digital)\n\nNow I need to enable history for both of these points. I can do that in parallel since they are independent operations."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64697, "output_tokens": 46, "latency_ms": 2246.8421999999464, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个点位的历史记录都已成功启用。让我确认一下配置情况：", "reasoning": "Both points have history enabled. Now let me verify by listing the history configurations."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64876, "output_tokens": 142, "latency_ms": 5680.86540000013, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "历史记录配置确认完毕。现在我来查询并导出这两个点的历史数据：", "reasoning": "Good, both histories are confirmed enabled. Now the user wants to export the data. Let me query the history for both tags. I'll use query_history to get some data for both points."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65791, "output_tokens": 437, "latency_ms": 11479.427800000167, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部完成！以下是总结：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 历史记录启用结果\n\n| 点位 | 类型 | 存储模式 | 采样间隔 | 保留天数 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|----------|----------|------|\n| **P1** | 模拟量 | periodic (周期采样) | 1 秒 | 30 天 | ✔ 已启用 |\n| **P2** | 数字量 | on_change (变化存储) | — | 30 天 | ✔ 已启用 |\n\n---\n\n## 📊 历史数据导出（最近 60 秒）\n\n### P1（模拟量）— 20 条采样\n| 时间偏移(s) | 值 |\n|:-----------:|:-----:|\n| 0 | -0.4087 |\n| 1 | -0.2746 |\n| 2 | -0.1349 |\n| 3 | 0.0076 |\n| ... | ... |\n| 18 | 0.8367 |\n| 19 | 0.7502 |\n\n### P2（数字量）— 20 条采样\n| 时间偏移(s) | 值 |\n|:-----------:|:-----:|\n| 0 | -0.2746 |\n| 1 | -0.1349 |\n| 2 | 0.0076 |\n| ... | ... |\n| 18 | 0.7502 |\n| 19 | 0.6484 |\n\n---\n\n> **提示：** 如果你需要将历史数据以 **CSV / PDF / JSON** 等格式导出到文件，可以使用 `export_audit_trail` 或通过 **报告模板** (`create_report_template`) 来生成正式报表。需要我帮你配置吗？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All done. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 323996, "output_tokens": 938, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 34331.718300000146}, "judge": null}
