: "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.04659999990508368, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": "sha256:46e0b30fa2698844fb7637c311a883973ba341b299399d390e2de0622cf9ca91", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64233, "output_tokens": 96, "latency_ms": 3423.837800000001, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你完成这个操作。首先，让我查看现有的页面列表，找到车间一的页面。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Copy Workshop 1's page to Workshop 2\n2. Replace all 'WS1' point tags with 'WS2' in the new page\n3. Run validation before deployment\n\nLet me start by listing the existing pages to find the Workshop 1 page."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64380, "output_tokens": 508, "latency_ms": 13855.309199999965, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "找到了车间一的页面（ID: `ws1`）。接下来让我查看所有点位标签，了解 WS1 和 WS2 的情况：", "reasoning": "I found the Workshop 1 page with id \"ws1\". Now I need to:\n1. First, let me check what points are available to understand the WS1 tags\n2. Create a new page for Workshop 2\n3. Then I'll need to copy the widgets - but wait, there's no direct \"copy_page\" function available\n\nLet me look at the available tools more carefully. There's no \"copy_page\" function. I need to:\n1. Get the details of the ws1 page to understand its widgets\n2. Create a new page for ws2\n3. Recreate the widgets on the new page\n4. Bind WS2 points instead of WS1\n\nBut wait - I don't have a function to \"get page details\" or \"get widgets on a page\" directly. Let me check what tools I have...\n\nI have `get_widget` which is a dynamic function. Let me try to get more information about the ws1 page's widgets. Actually, looking at the tools, I don't see a direct way to list widgets on a page or copy a page.\n\nLet me think about this differently. The user wants to:\n1. Copy the page layout/structure\n2. Replace WS1 with WS2 in point bindings\n\nSince there's no direct copy_page function, I should inform the user about the limitation. However, let me first try to get more info about the existing page's structure. Maybe I can use `get_widget` or similar tools.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the available tools, I see these are dynamic functions that might help:\n- get_widget - could help get widget details\n- list_points - could help see all points\n\nBut I don't have a \"list_widgets\" or \"get_page_details\" function that would let me enumerate all widgets on a specific page.\n\nLet me try a different approach - I'll try to get the ws1 page details and list all points to understand the structure. Then I can inform the user about the best approach.\n\nActually, wait - I should also check what WS1 points exist, so I know what WS2 points might need to be created or already exist.\n\n\nI'll start by retrieving the points list to see what WS1 and WS2 tags are currently defined."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 64992, "output_tokens": 506, "latency_ms": 14633.10730000012, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我看到了已有的点位。现在让我尝试获取车间一页面上的组件信息：", "reasoning": "OK, so there are only 2 points currently: WS1_Status and WS2_Status. \n\nThe user wants to copy the Workshop 1 page to Workshop 2, replacing WS1 with WS2 in point bindings. \n\nSince there's no direct \"copy_page\" function, I need to work with what I have. Let me try to get information about the widgets on the ws1 page. I'll use get_widget if possible.\n\nActually, looking at the tools again, I don't have a way to list widgets on a page or get detailed page structure. The tools I have are:\n- create_page - to create a new page\n- create_widget - to add widgets\n- bind_point - to bind points to widgets\n- delete_page - to delete a page\n\nBut there's no \"copy_page\", \"get_page_widgets\", or \"list_widgets_on_page\" function.\n\nI should inform the user that a direct page copy function is not available, and offer an alternative approach:\n1. Create a new ws2 page with the same resolution\n2. The user would need to manually recreate the widgets and bindings\n3. Or I could try using some of the dynamic functions to see if they can help\n\nWait, let me reconsider. Maybe I should just try to proceed with creating the new page and see if there are ways to get widget information. Let me try get_widget with the page_id to see if it returns something useful.\n\nActually, looking at the situation more carefully:\n- There's no copy_page function in my available tools\n- There's no list_widgets or get_page_details function\n- I cannot programmatically copy the layout\n\nI should be honest with the user about this limitation. However, I can:\n1. Create the new Workshop 2 page with the same background\n2. Explain that due to tool limitations, I cannot directly copy widgets\n3. Offer to help create widgets and bindings if the user describes what was on Workshop 1\n\nLet me inform the user about this and suggest an approach. Actually, let me first try to get some widget information to see if I can piece together the page structure.\n\n\nLet me attempt to retrieve widget details from the ws1 page using get_widget to see what information is available about the current layout and bindings."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 65521, "output_tokens": 484, "latency_ms": 16737.967300000037, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要坦诚地告知您一个限制：**当前可用工具中没有直接的\"复制页面\"功能**，也没有\"列出页面组件\"的功能来获取车间一页面上的所有控件详情。\n\n不过，我可以为您完成以下工作：\n\n---\n\n### 当前可执行的操作：\n\n1. **✅ 创建车间二页面** — 复制车间一的分辨率和背景设置\n2. **✅ 创建对应的 WS2 点位**（如果需要）\n3. **✅ 下装前校验** — 运行 `validate_project`\n\n---\n\n### 需要您配合的部分：\n\n由于无法自动获取车间一页面上的组件布局（控件类型、位置、绑定关系），**请您提供车间一页面上使用的组件清单**，例如：\n- 有哪些控件？（温度计、泵、阀门、趋势图等）\n- 每个控件绑定的是哪个 WS1 标签？\n\n---\n\n### 我先做能做的部分：\n\n让我先创建车间二页面，并立即运行校验：", "reasoning": "The get_widget didn't return useful information without specific parameters. I need to be upfront with the user - there's no direct \"copy_page\" functionality available in the current toolset.\n\nLet me explain the situation to the user and propose the best approach I can take:\n\n1. I can create a new page \"车间二\" \n2. But I cannot programmatically copy the widgets from 车间一 because there's no copy_page or list_widgets function\n3. I can help the user create widgets and bind them to WS2 points\n\nActually, let me reconsider the user's request. Perhaps they expect that I should have access to copy functionality. But based on my available tools, I truly don't have:\n- copy_page\n- list_widgets (to enumerate widgets on a page)\n- get_page_layout (to get the full page structure)\n\nI should explain this limitation honestly and offer what I can do. Let me create the new page and explain that I'll need information about the original widgets to recreate them."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 66075, "output_tokens": 302, "latency_ms": 8872.157000000016, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "完成！以下是当前状态汇总：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 已完成\n\n| 步骤 | 状态 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 创建车间二页面 | ✅ 完成 | 页面ID: `ws2`，白色背景 |\n| 下装前校验 | ✅ 通过 | 无错误，状态: `validated` |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 待您提供信息\n\n**车间一 → 车间二的组件复制**需要您提供以下信息，我才能帮您完成：\n\n1. **车间一页面上有哪些控件？**（例如：温度计、泵、阀门、储罐等）\n2. **每个控件绑定的是哪个 WS1 标签？**（例如：`WS1_Status`）\n3. **控件的大致位置和尺寸？**\n\n提供这些信息后，我可以立即在车间二页面上：\n- 创建对应的控件\n- 将 `WS1_*` 标签绑定替换为 `WS2_*`\n- 例如：`WS1_Status` → `WS2_Status`\n\n**校验已通过** ✅，页面创建完成后即可下装。请提供组件清单继续操作！", "reasoning": "Both operations succeeded:\n1. Created Workshop 2 page (id: ws2)\n2. Validation passed with no errors\n\nNow I should summarize what was done and what the user still needs to provide for the widget copy."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 325201, "output_tokens": 1896, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 58086.830199999895}, "judge": null}
